Q: why can&#39;t I use Rc::clone() directly when providing a parameter to a method? A: <p>I think @kmdreko's is a good answer (and even provided details about what is going on) so I am not going to unselect it as <strong>the</strong> answer.. however, through trial an error I found a different (simpler) way to solve the problem which will be handy for anybody that will come snoop around to learn how to go around the problem:</p>
<pre><code>struct2.add_child(struct1.clone());
</code></pre>
